  "transcription": "By hand, from pdftotext -layout of each PDF; each row is [player, school, position, year] as printed.",
  "notes": [
    "Records are W-L: a volleyball match cannot end level, so the PDF prints no ties and t is stored as 0.",
    "The standings PDF's file name reads \"2025-25\"; its title and its rows are 2025-26's.",
    "Each all-league document names an MVP and one all-league team with an honorable mention from each school; the varsity documents also name an Outstanding Senior, Junior, Sophomore and Freshman, who are on the team or the honorable mention list too. There is no second team.",
    "The De Anza documents print a player's graduating class (\"2028\"), the El Camino ones her grade (\"10\"); both are stored as the grade.",
    "The El Camino JV document spells Saratoga \"Saratgoa\" and prints the year of one of its players as \"7\", which is no high school grade, so that row has none.",
    "The El Camino varsity document prints its Outstanding Freshman's position over two lines (\"OH/O\" and \"PP\"), read as OH/OPP.",
    "JV membership is varsity's in both divisions."
